    "Your premium schedule, beautifully organized.\nKeep track of your classes and study hours with elegance.": {
      "comment": "Description text for the first onboarding slide in the WelcomeView.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il tuo programma premium, ben organizzato.\nTieni traccia delle tue lezioni e delle ore di studio con eleganza."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu agenda premium, bellamente organizada.\nLleva un seguimiento de tus clases y horas de estudio con elegancia."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre planning premium, magnifiquement organisé.\nGardez une trace de vos cours et de vos heures d'étude avec élégance."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ihr Premium-Terminplan, schön organisiert.\nBehalten Sie den Überblick über Ihre Kurse und Lernstunden mit Eleganz."
          }
        }
      }
